CM_ BO_ 562 "Per-module warnings (bits 0-2) and faults (bits 4-7) for Mod16-Mod23";
CM_ BO_ 563 "Per-module warnings (bits 0-2) and faults (bits 4-7) for Mod24-Mod31";
CM_ BO_ 768 "Logger RTC timestamp. TEL uses it once as a fallback until GPS time is valid.";
CM_ BO_ 800 "INA228 HV pack current, big-endian";
CM_ BO_ 801 "DIST treats any non-zero byte as an external fault";
CM_ BO_ 802 "Heartbeat. Firmware counter is uint16 sent big-endian in 4 bytes; bytes 0-1 are always 0.";
CM_ BO_ 803 "Sent once on entering LV_POWERUP; DIST starts on bit 0";
CM_ BO_ 805 "LV current sensor, big-endian";
CM_ BO_ 806 "DC-DC thermistor temperature, big-endian";
CM_ SG_ 806 DcdcTemperature "Firmware sends milli-degC";
CM_ BO_ 928 "32-bit big-endian counter (DIST PR 78)";
CM_ BO_ 929 "Sent from the DIST FAULT state";
CM_ BO_ 931 "Each step is 5 mA; saturates at 1275 mA";
CM_ BO_ 932 "Firmware branch ID";
CM_ BO_ 1025 "Motor command to MDI. Also sent immediately when the brake is pressed.";
CM_ SG_ 1027 SOC "SOC_MAX is 1.04 so values up to 104 are possible";
CM_ SG_ 1281 MDIMotorOverTemp "Set at 100 degC, cleared at 95 degC";
CM_ BO_ 1408 "Steering inputs. Firmware sends 8 bytes; bytes 4-7 are 0.";
